			"notes": "Author: nekodon\n\nInitial release for Fabric, supporting Minecraft 1.21.1 and 26.1.2 with separate JARs.\n\n- Right-click an adult animal with breeding food to feed nearby eligible animals.\n- Configurable radius of 2–10 blocks (default: 10).\n- Normal food consumption, offhand support, and Shift to bypass.\n- Optional Mod Menu settings in English and Japanese.\n\nFabric API is required. Install only the JAR matching your Minecraft version. In multiplayer, install on the server.\n\nBoth builds compile successfully. In-game behavior has not yet been manually tested.\n\nSource branches: `mc1.21.1` and `mc26.1.2`."
